---
// Old Mailchimp signup links (e.g. /signup/6-mistakes-guide) may still be on
// printed material or in past emails. Send them all to the newsletter page.
//
// Use a temporary (302) redirect. Browsers cache a 301 indefinitely, which is
// how visitors ended up stuck on the old 301 to Mailchimp, and the destination
// may change when guide signups move to their own Lawmatics forms.

// Rendered on demand: the site is otherwise static, and this matches any slug.
export const prerender = false;

return Astro.redirect("/newsletter", 302);
---
